{
  "title": "AWS Backup · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "여러 AWS 리소스의 백업 일정과 보존 정책을 한곳에서 관리합니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> Backup</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#guide-1\">백업 계획과 대상 지정</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#guide-2\">백업 보호와 복원 확인</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>스토리지</span><span>05 / 62</span></div><h1>AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> Backup</h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>AWS Backup은 <strong>여러 서비스의 백업을 공통 정책으로 관리하는 서비스</strong>입니다. 리소스마다 별도의 백업 작업을 만드는 대신 대상, 일정, 보존 기간을 계획으로 정할 수 있습니다.</p><p>백업을 생성하는 것뿐 아니라 다른 계정이나 리전으로 복사하고, 실제로 복원할 수 있는지 확인하는 운영까지 함께 설계합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"backup-plans-and-rules\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"resource-assignments\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"backup-vaults-and-recovery-points\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"lifecycle-and-cold-storage\"></span><h2>백업 계획과 대상 지정</h2><p>백업 계획에 실행 주기와 보존 기간을 정합니다. 리소스를 직접 지정하거나 태그로 묶어 백업 대상에 포함할 수 있습니다.</p><p>백업 결과는 백업 볼트에 복구 지점<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup>으로 보관합니다. 지원되는 리소스에서는 장기 보관 계층 전환, 연속 백업, 특정 시점 복구 등의 기능을 사용할 수 있습니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"cross-region-and-cross-account-copy\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"vault-lock\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"logically-air-gapped-vault\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"continuous-backup-and-pitr\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"restore-testing-and-audit-manager\"></span><h2>백업 보호와 복원 확인</h2><p>다른 계정이나 리전으로 복사하면 원본 환경의 사고에 대비할 수 있습니다. Vault Lock은 설정한 보존 정책에 따라 백업 삭제나 변경을 제한하는 데 사용합니다.</p><p>서비스별 지원 범위와 암호화 키 권한을 확인합니다. 복원 테스트로 데이터가 실제로 열리는지, 목표 복구 시간 안에 서비스를 시작할 수 있는지 검증합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>정책으로 백업 운영하기</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>대상 지정</strong><span>리소스·태그 선택</span></li><li><strong>백업 계획</strong><span>주기·보존·복사 설정</span></li><li><strong>복구 지점 보관</strong><span>볼트에서 관리</span></li><li><strong>복원 검증</strong><span>데이터·복구 시간 확인</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">백업 성공과 서비스 복구 가능 여부는 함께 확인해야 합니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>운영 태그가 붙은 EBS와 RDS를 매일 백업하고 별도 계정에 복사합니다. 정기 복원 테스트로 사고 시 사용할 절차를 점검합니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>복구 지점</strong> — 백업에서 복원할 수 있는 특정 시점의 데이터를 나타내는 단위입니다. 백업 대상과 방식에 따라 복구 가능한 시간과 기능이 달라집니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/aws-backup/latest/devguide/whatisbackup.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What is AWS Backup? ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q052/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q052\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q052\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q052</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q052/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to centrally manage backup schedules and retention policies for EBS and RDS across multiple accounts. Which service should it choose?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q052\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A Network Load Balancer</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q052\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An SCP alone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q052\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Backup</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q052\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon CloudFront</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">AWS Backup</a>은 지원 리소스의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">백업</a> 계획과 보존을 중앙화한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">AWS Backup</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q078\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q078\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q078</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q078/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A workload allows at most 15 minutes of data loss and must be restored within 2 hours. Which values correspond to those requirements?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q078\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Both are RPO values</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q078\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">RPO of 15 minutes and RTO of 2 hours</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q078\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Both are RTO values</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q078\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">RTO of 15 minutes and RPO of 2 hours</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-point-objective\">RPO</a>는 데이터 손실 허용 시점, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-time-objective\">RTO</a>는 서비스 복구까지 허용 시간이다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">RPO / RTO</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">AWS Backup</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1,3\" data-question=\"Q085\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q085\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q085</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q085/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which TWO S3 features help protect against accidental deletion and manage long-term retention?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q085\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A fixed Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q085\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Versioning</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q085\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Allow all traffic in a network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q085\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Lifecycle or retention policies</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q085\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"4\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">An RDS read replica</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B, D</strong> · 이전 버전을 유지하고 접근 패턴·보존 기간에 맞춰 수명 주기를 설정한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/\">S3 Storage Classes</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">AWS Backup</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0,2\" data-question=\"Q093\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q093\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q093</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q093/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which TWO targets must be established for a database recovery strategy that withstands a Region outage?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q093\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Recovery time objective (RTO)</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q093\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Only the network ACL rule number</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q093\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Recovery point objective (RPO)</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q093\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">The color of the AMI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q093\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"4\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">The length of an Elastic IP address name</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, C</strong> · 허용 데이터 손실과 복구 시간을 목표로 정해야 복제·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">백업</a> 전략을 선택할 수 있다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">RPO / RTO</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">AWS Backup</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q001\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q001\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q001</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q001/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An application must remain available during a prolonged outage of the entire Seoul Region. What is the minimum scope for replication?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q001\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A different AWS Region</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q001\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A different subnet in the Seoul Region</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q001\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A different Availability Zone in the Seoul Region</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q001\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A different ENI in the same Availability Zone</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 분리는 한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a> 안의 장애를 다룬다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a> 수준 장애는 별도 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a> 복제와 전환이 필요하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">RPO / RTO</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/\">이전 용어 <b>Aurora</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">다음 용어 <b>AZ</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
